>>
Rule 1 (input must be a tensor, not a dtype; suppresses AttributeError)
{v_1 : tensor ⊎ dtype} |= ndim(v_1) ≥ 0
>>
Rule 2 (all dimensions are defined and non-negative when rank > 0)
{v_1 : tensor} |= if ndim(v_1) > 0 then ∀i ∈ [0, ndim(v_1) - 1] : shape(v_1, i) ≥ 0
>>
Rule 3 (if non-scalar, the first dimension must be at least 1)
{v_1 : tensor} |= if ndim(v_1) ≥ 1 then shape(v_1, 0) ≥ 1
>>
Rule 4 (min/max along a valid axis are ordered)
{v_1 : tensor} |= if ndim(v_1) ≥ 1 then min(v_1, 0) ≤ max(v_1, 0)
>>
Rule 5 (dtype must be retrievable for the input tensor)
{v_1 : tensor} |= dtype_(v_1) = dtype_(v_1)
>>
Rule 6 (dimension sizes are within 32-bit bounds when rank > 0)
{v_1 : tensor} |= if ndim(v_1) > 0 then ∀i ∈ [0, ndim(v_1) - 1] : shape(v_1, i) ≤ 2147483647
